WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.208
The springs push the bottoms of the wafers into a groove in the housing.

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:02.833
All five wafers now fit inside the plug. Look along their bottom edges.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:05.333
The wafers turn with the plug. The cam turns behind the door.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:06.917
The cam has cleared the frame. The door can swing open.
